WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.709 --> 00:00:04.504
[woman 1] Why does it have to be
the one person that I did everything with?

00:00:04.587 --> 00:00:07.590
He would have given anything
to protect her.

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:10.385
[woman 2] Everyone was like,
"Paul, don't drive,"

00:00:10.468 --> 00:00:13.388
and Paul would snap back and be like,
"Well, this is my ******* boat."

00:00:13.972 --> 00:00:15.807
He was out-of-his-mind drunk.

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:18.935
Do y'all know Alex Murdaugh?
That's his son.

00:00:19.811 --> 00:00:21.980
I heard a scream, and then a bang.

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:25.608
- [operator] 911, where is your emergency?
- [man 1] What bridge is this?

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:28.528
And then that's when we all
started screaming for Mallory.

00:00:28.611 --> 00:00:29.988
[woman screams] Mallory!

00:00:30.071 --> 00:00:32.282
Where the **** is Mallory?!

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:34.743
[man 2] Alex wasn't worried
about finding Mallory.

00:00:34.826 --> 00:00:36.703
[man 3] He wanted to make sure that...

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:38.621
lips were sealed.

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:40.498
They were more worried about a cover-up.

00:00:40.582 --> 00:00:43.585
[reporter 1] Five made it ashore alive.
Mallory Beach did not.

00:00:43.668 --> 00:00:46.713
[reporter 2] Paul had been
receiving threats from strangers.

00:00:46.796 --> 00:00:47.464
He was scared.

00:00:47.505 --> 00:00:49.257
[man 4] Speculation is runnin' wild.

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:52.469
[man 5] For over a century,
the Murdaughs were law and order

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:53.720
here in the 14th circuit.

00:00:54.512 --> 00:00:56.765
The family was under
increasing amount of stress.

00:00:56.848 --> 00:00:58.850
[operator] Hampton County 911,
what's your emergency?

00:00:58.933 --> 00:01:01.770
[man 6] My wife and child
have been shot badly.

00:01:01.853 --> 00:01:03.480
It didn't seem real at the time.

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:06.191
[woman 3] The double homicides
of Maggie and Paul changed everything.

00:01:06.274 --> 00:01:09.861
Think this may very well be related
to the death of Mallory Beach.

00:01:09.944 --> 00:01:12.447
What was the motivation
other than revenge?

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:14.991
[man 7] There are facts that don't add up,

00:01:15.075 --> 00:01:17.619
and bodies tied to this family.

00:01:18.203 --> 00:01:19.454
[dramatic music playing]

00:01:19.537 --> 00:01:21.956
The Murdaughs would
just make someone disappear.

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:24.584
[woman 4] There were so many rumors

00:01:24.667 --> 00:01:26.961
that Buster and Stephen
were intimate together.

00:01:27.045 --> 00:01:30.173
[man 8] Stephen's death is now intertwined
with the Murdaughs.

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:34.344
[woman 5] Gloria had found drugs
under Alex's bed.

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:35.804
She knew too much.

00:01:35.887 --> 00:01:36.805
[woman 4] Moselle.

00:01:36.888 --> 00:01:38.932
This, like, massive playground.

00:01:39.015 --> 00:01:43.353
The way Paul told it, it was
for drugs and strippers and everything.

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:46.314
You can't believe
everything Paul says neither.

00:01:46.898 --> 00:01:49.692
[woman 4] They were okay with us drinking.
They'd always get us alcohol.

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:51.486
You drink like that to escape.

00:01:51.569 --> 00:01:54.989
This is the fall of a dynasty.
It was a fall from grace.

00:01:55.907 --> 00:01:58.910
[woman 4] I do believe that Alex Murdaugh
would kill Paul and Maggie.

00:01:59.744 --> 00:02:03.081
There you are, scared for your life.
And it's either do or die.

